.TH FL-CALC 1 "November 2026" "fldesktop 0.1.0" "fldesktop"
.SH NAME
fl-calc \- calculator
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfl-calc\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
A basic and scientific calculator. Type expressions with the keyboard,
e.g. 2(3+4)^2, sqrt(2), 5!, sin(30), 15%; Enter evaluates, Escape clears.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBfl-wm\fR(1), \fBfl-session\fR(1), \fBfl-panel\fR(1)
